{"id":"m4e95mlolwlu0gw5yay49rql7","title":"天然气地球化学发展历史","originalTitle":null,"summary":"天然气地球化学从18世纪意大利科学家伏打研究沼泽气体开始，历经化学组成分析、成因理论探索、稳定同位素判别体系建立等阶段，现已发展为研究油气资源形成与分布、地球深部流体活动及全球碳循环的重要学科。20世纪70年代，经典天然气成因判别图解形成；2010年以来，研究重点转向复杂地质条件下天然气的形成机制及后期改造过程。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3549522&do=blog&id=1561520"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T01:41:28.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T06:33:42.744Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T06:33:42.744Z","category":"materials-energy","tags":["论文发表"],"score":14,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"04be4f0e-b79b-41b0-8d70-07df1d243743","title":"天然气地球化学学科发展历程及研究重心转移"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"04be4f0e-b79b-41b0-8d70-07df1d243743","title":"天然气地球化学学科发展历程及研究重心转移"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fkixp5pHhU-w","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}